* Illustrative 1N5305 current-regulator diode, not a manufacturer SPICE model.
* Central Semiconductor datasheet: 2.0 mA nominal at 25 V, 1.7 to 2.3 mA.
* Single JFET approximation is fitted only to the forward regulating quadrant.
